# 📡 ns-3 5G vs. Wi-Fi Performance Simulation 🚀  

## 📌 Project Overview  
This project **compares the performance of 5G (mmWave) vs. Wi-Fi (802.11ac)** using **ns-3**.  

- **Simulates a network with 2 devices (client & server)**  
- **Tests network performance under different conditions**  
- **Analyzes latency, throughput, and packet loss for 5G & Wi-Fi**  

---

